        "description": "# Can You Escape in Time? \n\nAnother Door is an escape room experience that plunges you into a series of immersive, unsettling environments, each with its own unique story and chilling challenges. \n\nMake it to the exit either alone or with friends – the choice is yours!\n\nFrom a trap-filled lair built by a mad scientist, to a haunted doll's room cursed by the spirit of a dead child, and a secret laboratory where hallucinations blur reality, every episode delivers a fresh and thrilling mystery!\n{1488232228733301}\n\n# More Than Meets the Eye\n\nAnother Door offers five distinct episodes, each with a new theme, story, and puzzle mechanics. Players can select episodes as if choosing books from a library, ensuring that no two adventures feel the same.\n{3924225681161547}\n\n# The Ultimate Test\n\nWhether facing the unknown alone or with friends, Another Door delivers an unforgettable VR adventure filled with suspense, teamwork, and intricate puzzles that will push your mind to its limits.\n{1181167996493086}\n\n\n# Key Features\n\n - Find hidden collectibles scattered\n - Experience five unique themes with their own puzzles\n - Escape before it’s too late\n - Immersive audio de5ign\n - Online co-op",
